{
  "name": "@godcreator/gwb-collab",
  "version": "0.29.3",
  "description": "协作站的 gwb 插件：协作窗格里管理多个项目（站点交给 gwb-docsite 初始化、托管并推送通知、提交审核、自动同步），Gitea 一有事件就经实时推送取回，项目里别的仓只取回和提醒、在项目里建仓，协作仓与别的仓此刻的状态算成通知交给网站顶部的提示栏，协作窗格里点「交给 AI 处理」时交给 ZCode（经服务 gwbZcode）或新开 Claude Code 终端窗口，新出现的通知经 gwbQqBot 私聊主人，起了 QQ 命令的项目经 gwbQqBot 注册成 QQ 任务组；查看我的待办、建改任务与模块",
  "type": "module",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./dist/index.js"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "skills"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "gwb-plugin"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://git.tianshen02.online:28377/godcreator/docsite-kit.git"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "registry": "https://git.tianshen02.online:28377/api/packages/godcreator/npm/"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node build.ts && tailwindcss -i src/pane/browser/styles.css -o dist/style.css",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json && tsc --noEmit -p src/pane/browser/tsconfig.json",
    "lint": "oxlint . --deny-warnings",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "check": "pnpm run typecheck && pnpm run lint && pnpm run test"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@godcreator/gwb-data": "^0.1.12",
    "@cordisjs/plugin-timer": "^1.1.3",
    "@godcreator/gwb-commands": "^0.6.0",
